{
 "desc": "The relay's diet, four players in one room at real speed sharing the four-Goomba battle: the host sends one relay message for all three others (the relay splits it, \"caps split\"), so it costs about what one player's does: at most 900 messages a minute of play each, the host's too (0.5.0: 3,600 the host's, 1,200 each other's); nothing sent twice while linked",
 "groups": [
  "online",
  "relaydiet"
 ],
 "versions": [
  "us"
 ],
